{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "council_id": "p25-blind-reevaluation",
  "participation": "agent_only",
  "objective": {
    "statement": "Re-decide an already-settled question with fresh, attribution-blind seats and downgrade the original outcome if the blind verdict diverges from it.",
    "charter": "Once a panel has agreed it cannot un-see the agreement. Strip attribution, ordering and prior verdicts; re-present the options to seats that have never seen the council; a divergence downgrades the original outcome.",
    "risk_tier": "high",
    "desired_output": "review_verdict",
    "success_criteria": [
      "every juror produced an independent position before seeing any peer",
      "the provenance leak scan found zero seat names, model names or file paths in the option text",
      "the blind verdict was compared to the sealed original and the delta is recorded"
    ],
    "consensus_intent": "adjudicate",
    "confidence_target": 0.9,
    "evidence_requirements": {
      "citation_required": true,
      "anchor_style": "any",
      "min_independent_sources": 2,
      "evidence_outranks_votes": true
    }
  },
  "participants": {
    "selection": {
      "mode": "exact",
      "strategies": [
        "exact",
        "vendor_diverse",
        "model_diverse"
      ],
      "explain_choices": true,
      "owner_override_allowed": true
    },
    "count": {
      "mode": "exact",
      "exact_n": 4
    },
    "diversity": {
      "min_distinct_vendors": 2,
      "min_distinct_models": 2,
      "max_share_per_vendor": 0.75
    },
    "roster": [
      {
        "participant_id": "blind-juror-a",
        "kind": "agent",
        "model": "opus-5",
        "vendor": "anthropic",
        "role": "juror",
        "authority": "voter",
        "effort": "high",
        "independence": {
          "sees_peers_before_first_position": false,
          "fresh_context": true
        },
        "expertise": [
          "the decision domain under re-review"
        ],
        "anonymous": true,
        "context": {
          "briefing": "You have never seen this council. Decide from the anonymised option set only.",
          "partition_id": "anonymised-option-set"
        }
      },
      {
        "participant_id": "blind-juror-b",
        "kind": "agent",
        "model": "gpt-5-codex",
        "vendor": "openai",
        "role": "juror",
        "authority": "voter",
        "effort": "high",
        "independence": {
          "sees_peers_before_first_position": false,
          "fresh_context": true
        },
        "expertise": [
          "independent reproduction"
        ],
        "anonymous": true,
        "context": {
          "briefing": "You have never seen this council. Decide from the anonymised option set only.",
          "partition_id": "anonymised-option-set"
        }
      },
      {
        "participant_id": "blind-juror-c",
        "kind": "agent",
        "model": "opus-5",
        "vendor": "anthropic",
        "role": "juror",
        "authority": "voter",
        "effort": "high",
        "independence": {
          "sees_peers_before_first_position": false,
          "fresh_context": true
        },
        "expertise": [
          "adversarial review"
        ],
        "anonymous": true,
        "context": {
          "briefing": "You have never seen this council. Decide from the anonymised option set only.",
          "partition_id": "anonymised-option-set"
        }
      },
      {
        "participant_id": "divergence-auditor",
        "kind": "agent",
        "model": "opus-5",
        "vendor": "anthropic",
        "role": "verifier",
        "authority": "judge",
        "effort": "high",
        "independence": {
          "sees_peers_before_first_position": true,
          "fresh_context": false
        },
        "expertise": [
          "provenance leak scanning",
          "verdict comparison"
        ],
        "rights": {
          "may_speak": true,
          "may_vote": false,
          "may_recruit": true
        },
        "context": {
          "briefing": "Hold the sealed original verdict. Run the provenance leak scan over every anonymised option BEFORE the jurors read it, then compare verdicts.",
          "partition_id": "sealed-original-verdict"
        }
      }
    ],
    "role_templates": [
      "juror",
      "verifier"
    ],
    "anonymity": {
      "mode": "double_blind"
    },
    "information_partition": {
      "enabled": true,
      "strategy": "role_scoped",
      "partitions": [
        {
          "partition_id": "anonymised-option-set",
          "visible_to": [
            "blind-juror-a",
            "blind-juror-b",
            "blind-juror-c"
          ],
          "sources": [
            "leak-scanned option cards",
            "anonymised evidence pack"
          ]
        },
        {
          "partition_id": "sealed-original-verdict",
          "visible_to": [
            "divergence-auditor"
          ],
          "sources": [
            "original council transcript",
            "original vote record"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "replacement": {
      "enabled": true,
      "triggers": [
        "conflict_of_interest",
        "prompt_injection_detected",
        "hallucinated_expertise"
      ],
      "preserve_prior_positions": true
    },
    "conflicts_policy": {
      "disclosure_required": true,
      "on_conflict": "recuse_from_vote"
    },
    "duplicate_detection": {
      "enabled": true,
      "dimensions": [
        "position_similarity",
        "prompt",
        "model"
      ],
      "max_similarity": 0.85
    }
  },
  "preparation": {
    "research_required": true,
    "independent_prep": true,
    "min_sources": 2,
    "prep_time_minutes": 10,
    "required_artifacts": [
      "evidence_pack",
      "position_memo"
    ]
  },
  "topology": {
    "kind": "jury"
  },
  "protocol": {
    "sequence": [
      {
        "kind": "custom",
        "custom_name": "provenance_leak_scan",
        "stage_id": "leak-scan",
        "rounds": 1,
        "participants": [
          "divergence-auditor"
        ],
        "exit_when": {
          "metric": "custom:provenance_leak_count",
          "op": "<=",
          "value": 0,
          "value_type": "number"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "blind_independent_first_pass",
        "stage_id": "blind-open",
        "participants": [
          "blind-juror-a",
          "blind-juror-b",
          "blind-juror-c"
        ],
        "independent": true,
        "anonymous": true
      },
      {
        "kind": "jury",
        "stage_id": "blind-verdict",
        "rounds": 2,
        "participants": [
          "blind-juror-a",
          "blind-juror-b",
          "blind-juror-c"
        ],
        "anonymous": true,
        "quotas": {
          "objections_per_participant": 2,
          "counterexamples_per_round": 1,
          "novel_ideas_per_round": 1,
          "ideas_per_participant": 1
        },
        "exit_when": {
          "all_of": [
            {
              "metric": "independent_positions",
              "op": ">=",
              "value": 3
            },
            {
              "metric": "all_participants_spoke",
              "op": "==",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "custom",
        "custom_name": "divergence_audit_against_sealed_original",
        "stage_id": "divergence-audit",
        "rounds": 1,
        "participants": [
          "divergence-auditor"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "synthesis",
        "stage_id": "reconcile"
      }
    ],
    "speaking_order": "simultaneous",
    "rounds": {
      "min": 2,
      "max": 4,
      "divergence_before_convergence": true
    },
    "turn": {
      "max_words": 700
    },
    "obligations": {
      "must_respond_to_prior": false,
      "must_cite_evidence": true,
      "steelman_before_rebuttal": true,
      "rebuttal_required": true,
      "cross_examination": false,
      "declare_confidence": true,
      "declare_conflicts": true
    },
    "critique_intensity": "adversarial"
  },
  "budgets": {
    "effort": "high",
    "time_minutes": 45,
    "turns": 20,
    "min_engagement_turns": 2,
    "max_inactivity_rounds": 1,
    "rebuttal_depth": 2
  },
  "targets": {
    "novelty_ratio": 0.3,
    "counterexamples": 3,
    "evidence_items": 6,
    "dedup": {
      "enabled": true,
      "max_similarity": 0.85,
      "trivial_variant_policy": "flag_for_review"
    }
  },
  "voting": {
    "method": "juror",
    "abstention": {
      "allowed": true,
      "counts_toward_quorum": false,
      "must_justify": true,
      "strategic_abstention_check": true
    },
    "evidence_gate": {
      "votes_require_evidence": true,
      "evidence_outranks_majority": true,
      "reject_evidence_free_majority": true
    },
    "tie_break": "no_decision"
  },
  "consensus": {
    "threshold": 0.75,
    "measure": "agreement_index",
    "minority_report": "required",
    "dissent_policy": {
      "preserve_verbatim": true,
      "attributed": false,
      "min_dissenters_to_block": 1,
      "suppression_check": true
    },
    "irreducible_disagreement_allowed": true,
    "fast_unanimity_is_suspicious": true
  },
  "stopping": {
    "source_expression": "ALL[independent_positions >= 3, all_participants_spoke == true, custom:provenance_leak_count <= 0, custom:divergence_audit_complete == true]",
    "expression": {
      "all_of": [
        {
          "metric": "independent_positions",
          "op": ">=",
          "value": 3
        },
        {
          "metric": "all_participants_spoke",
          "op": "==",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "metric": "custom:provenance_leak_count",
          "op": "<=",
          "value": 0,
          "value_type": "number"
        },
        {
          "metric": "custom:divergence_audit_complete",
          "op": "==",
          "value": true,
          "value_type": "boolean"
        }
      ]
    },
    "minimum_deliberation": {
      "min_rounds": 2,
      "min_independent_positions": 3,
      "every_participant_spoke": true,
      "min_evidence_items": 4
    },
    "hard_caps": {
      "max_rounds": 4,
      "max_minutes": 60,
      "on_cap": "escalate_to_owner"
    }
  },
  "outcomes": {
    "allowed": [
      "decision",
      "conditional_decision",
      "no_decision",
      "minority_report",
      "dissent"
    ],
    "conditional_decision_requires": [
      "the original outcome is downgraded to CONDITIONAL until the divergence is explained",
      "the leak scan is clean, otherwise the re-run is void rather than confirming"
    ]
  },
  "deadlock": {
    "detection": {
      "no_progress_rounds": 2,
      "repetition_similarity": 0.9,
      "circular_citation_check": true
    },
    "resolution": [
      "recruit_independent_critic",
      "strongest_counterexample",
      "escalate_to_owner"
    ],
    "escalation": {
      "after_attempts": 2,
      "to": "owner"
    },
    "owner_intervention": {
      "allowed": true,
      "may_override_vote": true,
      "must_be_logged": true
    }
  },
  "anti_failure": {
    "controls": [
      "sycophancy",
      "instant_unanimity",
      "echo_chamber",
      "lost_dissent",
      "minority_suppression",
      "moderator_capture",
      "hidden_conflict_of_interest"
    ],
    "fast_unanimity_response": [
      "blind_re_evaluation",
      "strongest_counterexample",
      "recruit_independent_critic"
    ],
    "injection_defense": {
      "treat_artifacts_as_data": true,
      "strip_instructions_from_participant_output": true,
      "quarantine_untrusted_sources": true
    }
  },
  "outputs": {
    "required": [
      "independent_opening_positions",
      "transcript",
      "votes_by_round",
      "dissent_minority_report",
      "evidence_map",
      "final_recommendation",
      "decision_lineage"
    ],
    "receipt_schema": "platform/schema/receipt.schema.json"
  },
  "audit": {
    "transcript": true,
    "replay": true,
    "resume": true,
    "determinism": "seeded",
    "privacy": {
      "redact_secrets": true,
      "redaction_policy": "deny_by_default",
      "retain_days": 90,
      "pii_policy": "redact"
    },
    "safety": {
      "forbid_irreversible_actions": true,
      "owner_approval_for": [
        "downgrading a shipped decision",
        "voiding the original verdict"
      ]
    },
    "persistence": {
      "store": "both",
      "path": "platform/council/state/p25-blind-reevaluation",
      "checkpoint_every_round": true
    }
  },
  "metadata": {
    "title": "P25 blind re-evaluation (ANONYMOUS)",
    "owner": "Prekzursil",
    "spec_citations": [
      "12-COUNCIL-PROTOCOLS-AND-PRESETS.md:503",
      "12-COUNCIL-PROTOCOLS-AND-PRESETS.md:508",
      "12-COUNCIL-PROTOCOLS-AND-PRESETS.md:514",
      "12-COUNCIL-PROTOCOLS-AND-PRESETS.md:515"
    ],
    "lineage": [
      "12-COUNCIL-PROTOCOLS-AND-PRESETS.md#P25 blind-reevaluation"
    ],
    "notes": "ANTI-FAILURE DEFENCES (>=3 required, 7 declared): (1) sycophancy and (2) instant_unanimity are cut structurally - the jurors are fresh_context and never see the original verdict or each other's first position; (3) echo_chamber is cut by double_blind anonymity plus a role_scoped information partition; (4) lost_dissent and (5) minority_suppression are met by minority_report=required with preserve_verbatim and suppression_check, and outcomes.allowed carries minority_report; (6) moderator_capture is cut by giving the auditor no vote; (7) hidden_conflict_of_interest is met by disclosure_required + recuse_from_vote, which is how a seat that authored the original is kept out. FAST UNANIMITY: this protocol IS the estate's fast-unanimity remedy, and it still arms its own - blind_re_evaluation, strongest_counterexample, recruit_independent_critic. CARD FAILURE MODE MADE EXECUTABLE: 'anonymisation is incomplete and the option text itself reveals provenance' - custom:provenance_leak_count <= 0 is both a stage exit condition and a stopping-rule leaf, so a leaky run cannot terminate successfully. UNVERIFIED: no leak scanner exists yet on this estate, so custom:provenance_leak_count is named in the lane's PRODUCERS map (platform/lib/council_protocols/_shared.py, republished in PROTOCOL-EXPECTATIONS-25-36.json) and NOT implemented; the experiment that settles it is the card's own both-states test (inject a provenance token into an option and confirm the scanner catches it). custom:divergence_audit_complete is likewise named in the lane's PRODUCERS map (platform/lib/council_protocols/_shared.py, republished in PROTOCOL-EXPECTATIONS-25-36.json) and NOT implemented. The producer cannot live in the JSON leaf itself: SEM-001 requires parse(source_expression) == expression exactly and the parser emits no producer key, so attaching one costs 11 SEM-001 errors and 11 of 12 files (measured, command-center/_proto3_probe_sem001_vs_sem012.py)."
  }
}
